# Workspace context

You are working inside a **cind workspace** — one tmux session, one directory, one or more project checkouts underneath.

## Layout

- Workspace root is **not** a git repository — start here, then `cd` into projects.
- Each project subdirectory matches `projects[].name` in `.manifest.json`.
- Cross-repo rules live in `.cursor/rules/` at the workspace root.

## Mount modes

| Mode | Work inside container | Host Docker socket |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `parity` | use `path` (same as host) | yes |
| `workspace` | use `workspace_path` under this root | no |

## Scope

- Read `.manifest.json` before cross-repo edits.
- Repo rules stay in each project's own `.cursor/`.
